    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλε-κλειτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
			(<i><span class="en">
			A.R.
			3.1097
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>far-famed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φοῖνιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.321
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐφιάλτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.308
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰκάριος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.546
				</span></i>
			; so also as epith. of the Trojan <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκουροι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.491
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.564
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				12.108
			</span></i>; written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλε-κλητοί</span></b>  in some codd. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλειτός</span> fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλεϝετος</span>,
			cf. sq.)</div>
